OL,3,GNEWSAEasyjet launches direct Jersey to
OL,4,AParis flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FEasyJet is to launch a new direct route
OL,7,Fbetween Jersey and Paris Orly, giving
OL,8,Fislanders what it said was a non-stop
OL,9,Flink to the French capital for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,12,FThe airline said flights would begin on
OL,13,F30 March and operate twice a week, on
OL,14,FTuesdays and Saturdays.
OL,16,FThe Paris route expands easyJet's
OL,17,Fnetwork from Jersey, which already
OL,18,Fincludes flights to London Gatwick,
OL,19,FLondon Luton, Manchester, Liverpool,
OL,20,FBirmingham, London Southend, Glasgow,
OL,21,FEdinburgh and Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
