OL,3,GNEWSAEasyjet launches direct Jersey to
OL,4,AParis flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move was described as "really
OL,7,Fwelcome news for Jersey and our visitor
OL,8,Feconomy" by Paul Holley, head of
OL,9,Fconnectivity at Ports of Jersey.
